- [OpenAI compatibility](https://docs.fireworks.ai/tools-sdks/openai-compatibility.md): Use the OpenAI Python and JavaScript SDKs with Fireworks by pointing base_url at api.fireworks.ai, with notes on supported endpoints and request fields.
- [Anthropic compatibility](https://docs.fireworks.ai/tools-sdks/anthropic-compatibility.md): Use Anthropic SDKs with Fireworks through the Anthropic-compatible Messages API, including supported fields, tool search, defer_loading, and streaming behavior.
- [NIM compatibility](https://docs.fireworks.ai/tools-sdks/nim-compatibility.md): Point NVIDIA NIM and vLLM OpenAI clients at Fireworks with translated request extras like chat_template_kwargs to avoid Extra inputs are not permitted errors.
