- [How does billing and credit usage work?](https://docs.fireworks.ai/faq-new/billing-pricing/how-does-billing-and-credit-usage-work.md): How Fireworks pre-paid credits work across serverless, on-demand deployments, and fine-tuning, plus auto top-up, budget caps, and balance-zero behavior.
- [How do credits work?](https://docs.fireworks.ai/faq-new/billing-pricing/what-happens-when-i-finish-my-1-dollar-credit.md): What happens when your $1 starter credit is depleted on Fireworks, how to add a payment method, enable auto top-up, and lift account spend tier limits.
- [Why might my account be suspended even with remaining credits?](https://docs.fireworks.ai/faq-new/billing-pricing/why-might-my-account-be-suspended-even-with-remaining-credits.md): Why a Fireworks account can be suspended despite remaining credits, including monthly budget caps, payment risk checks, and post-paid contract terms.
