- [Are there extra fees for serving trained models?](https://docs.fireworks.ai/faq-new/billing-pricing/are-there-extra-fees-for-serving-fine-tuned-models.md): How Fireworks bills for serving trained LoRA models on dedicated deployments, including per-GPU-second hosting costs, training fees, and inference charges.
